@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@ingestToken = replace-locally-do-not-commit-a-real-token

### Plain chat (only Groq is required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chatbot/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Suggest a simple chatbot feature for a hackathon.",
  "history": [],
  "useRetrieval": false
}

### Add a document (requires embeddings, Supabase, and private ingestion token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chatbot/documents
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ingestToken}}

{
  "title": "Event guide",
  "source": "event-guide.txt",
  "text": "AI Manthan takes place at AITR, Indore. Teams have 24 hours to build a new project."
}

### Ask the knowledge base
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chatbot/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Where is AI Manthan being held?",
  "history": [],
  "useRetrieval": true
}

### Follow-up with explicit conversation history
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chatbot/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "How long do teams have?",
  "history": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "Where is AI Manthan being held?" },
    { "role": "assistant", "content": "At AITR, Indore." }
  ],
  "useRetrieval": true
}
